WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.040
Te he estado esperando.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.960
I was expecting a redhead.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.800
A blonde…

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.560
will just have to do.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.560
You smell like gooseberries.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.680
I like it.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.760
Delete it. Right now.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.440
Ma'am, I can't possibly—

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.440
Robert?

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.640
Okay. Okay.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.880
I'm so sorry.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.520
Did you find

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:19.520
what you were looking for?

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.360
Yeah. Yeah. Thank you.

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.120
We can go now.

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.320
Did you pick a place for…

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.280
dinner?

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:33.360
Well, isn't that a surprise?
